Fit eorum memoria in can. Missae, 3.</ITEM> <ITEM>Simplicii (S.) natale, quarto Kal.
Aug. 408, 704. Alter sanctus Simplicius
martyr, 139, 421, 608.</ITEM> <ITEM>Sindone munda corpora defunctorum
involuta, 484.</ITEM> <ITEM>Sisinnius (S.) diaconus martyr, Romae
passus sub Maximiano imperatore, 423.</ITEM> <ITEM>Sixti (S.) papae nomen recitatur in
