413.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Suntavssesqai,</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">id est</HI>  profiteri se Christo
serviturum et adhaesurum, 383.</ITEM> <ITEM>Super oblata, cur dicatur oratio, et
secreta, 294.</ITEM> <ITEM>Superbia hominis duplex contra
Deum, 368.</ITEM> <ITEM>Superhumerale Graeci dicunt  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>wjmofovrion,</FOREIGN> 
