 <COL N="1461"></COL> Baptismi ministri etiam diaconi, XCVI.</ITEM> <ITEM>Baptizatorum susceptores, XCVI.</ITEM> <ITEM>Basilicarum Romae numerus saeculo
tertio, XII, XIII.</ITEM> <ITEM>Bedae locus de cereo paschali, CI.</ITEM> <ITEM>Benedictio episcopalis in Missa ante
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Agnus Dei,</HI>  LII. Benedictionale male assutum
